Z||000002||foxgapfiero||11-17-2001||06:27 AM||||I have the chip from Joe Wynman in my 86 GT with a 3.4 5-speed. The chip was DEFINTLY worth the $105.00 I paid for it. Just realize you are going to have to change your injectors to 24#ers to make this chip work the best. The last I heard he was making a chip for the 3.4 with the Auto also. Here is the addy I used to order from him   Fierojo@bellatlantic.net   Hope this helps  <P>------------------<BR>Mark Hoagland<BR>86GT 3.4<BR>88GT T-Top<BR>85GT caddy v-8 next swap<BR>84SE trailer next project||||reg||1
Z||000003||LoW_KeY||11-17-2001||12:04 PM||||So the differenet injectors help also? I planned on changing the injectors when I do the rebuild.<P>Don't get me wrong the car still hauls and when my TB was bad I've given one hell of a race to a 95 350 camaro, but hope for all that to change after the rebuild and new chip.<P>Thanks for the reply! I've heard about the chip just never anyone saying if it was worth it.  I'll have to snag the chip when I get my door scratch fixed and new tires next spring.<P>Thanks!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
